On 11/30/2010 05:42 PM, Alex Rozenshteyn wrote:
> Would "Me too" be {.ije mi} or {.i ji'a mi} or something else?

Depending on the sentence structure, you can use one of the go'X series
cmavo (like go'i, previous bridi) to repeat the previous sentiment and
append ra'o, which "reinterprets" all referents, like this:

mi nelci lo mlatu =97 i like cats
go'i ra'o =97 i like cats, too

do bebna =97 you're stupid
go'i ra'o =97 you too

also this:

mi nelci ti =97 i like this
go'i ra'o =97 and i like *this*

mu'o mi'e timos

